   - feat: "Plan & billing" in the sidebar for admins, and a billing page to choose, pay for, change and cancel a plan with Razorpay checkout
   - feat: change plan from the billing page: subscribers see "Upgrade to" and "Downgrade to" instead of "Choose"; a dialog shows what happens and what is due before anything is charged (upgrade starts now, downgrade at the end of the period); a switch that is scheduled shows a banner with a "Keep {plan}" link
   - feat: the billing-period toggle is hidden once subscribed, since a change keeps the current billing cycle
   - feat: a plan you have already paid for can't be bought again; the button says when renewal opens
