   - feat: quotation: inline qty/rate/price/status edit, "Save & add another", delete with Undo, live price preview, searchable material picker that prefills the line
   - feat: quotation lines link back to their source conversation and design
   - feat: designs: add all hotspots to the quotation, room prefilled from design tags, "in quotation" markers, multi-image upload with drop zone and progress, hotspot delete with Undo
   - feat: sharing: expiry presets, send panel (WhatsApp, email, share, copy), confirm before stop sharing, created date, view count and customer responses in the share list
   - feat: shared pages: customers can approve or ask a question; separate "expired" and "try again" states; mobile item cards and expand/collapse all on quotations
   - feat: board: compact "Move to" menu beside the drag handle as a non-drag fallback; error state with retry on board, clients, portfolio, quotation, dashboard and client detail
   - feat: team: one-time credentials modal, styled confirms for reset/remove, enable/disable feedback
   - feat: dashboard "Get started" checklist; tappable phone and email on client detail
   - fix: login labels, autocomplete, 44px password toggle; "Forgot password" replaced by guidance (was a dead button)
   - fix: form labels linked to inputs (new client, team, account); tel/email input types; viewer role label
   - fix: sidebar toggle size, aria-expanded/aria-current, nav label; closing the design editor clears ?edit=
   - feat: one control height token (40px, 44px on touch) shared by buttons, inputs, chips, tabs and segmented controls; shared .btn-*, .filter-chip and .seg-btn classes
   - feat: team member, team access and customer approve/question forms open as a popup on desktop and a right-sliding sheet with a back arrow on phones
   - feat: design item links jump to and highlight the exact quotation row
   - feat: client Details lists shared links inline; the Conversations/Designs/Quotation shortcut buttons are gone
   - feat: client phase is a segmented tracker with a "Move to next" button, replacing the dropdown on the board and in Details
   - feat: team access card shows who has access, with a searchable Manage popup, select all/clear and a locked owner for large teams
   - feat: add images to a quotation version through a multi-select picker with "Add N images"; the Images tab autosaves
   - feat: team and quotation columns pages centred like settings and guide
   - fix: quotation columns Add button matches the field height; filter pills no longer clash with the status pill style
   - feat: notification bell in the header (desktop and phone) counts customer replies and other items waiting on you, refreshes every minute and on focus
   - feat: toast with a View action when a customer reply arrives while you work
   - feat: bell items can be marked read (on open, or "Mark all as read"); only unread items count in the badge, client tab badges and the dashboard card
   - feat: version list marks the shared version and shows the customer's question or approval on its row, so no version needs opening to read it
   - feat: sharing a version is a popup (Share button on the version page and on every row of the list); the Share tab is gone, and the link moves to the version you share, so the customer keeps one link
   - feat: a customer reply shows at the top of its version with what to do next: WhatsApp, email, edit quotation, or mark as agreed
   - feat: new conversation shows a live character count (limit 15,000) and disables Extract with a "add it in smaller parts" message when over
   - feat: saving a version while the customer has a live link asks "Show this on my customer's link" (off by default); on, the same link shows the new version
   - feat: sharing a version when the customer already has a link offers "Show version N on this link" (with the current link and a Copy button) instead of creating a second link

